{"server":"tw","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_07_beg","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_07","title":"何以忘卻","storyCode":"IS-7","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"50cd33da932ddf64f160801a741ce3787aa5dec6c0d1aea766286ffaa3440440","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"觀眾們早已四散逃離，殺手們的戰場也早已轉移到別處，每個人都開始回憶那場過往。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空，你沒事吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我還好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去找德克薩斯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......剛才打照面的時候，她讓我等她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們也先去避一避吧，現在其他地方都已經亂作一團了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們不想失去她的話，我建議你們追上她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普蘭德......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g8_srcroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得拉普蘭德也是一樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像她們這樣的人，與其去猜她們到底在想什麼，不如乾脆地接受她們的每一句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有相信她們的每一句話都是真的，才能看穿她們最後是不是在用真實編織一個謊言。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道的吧，那間房間裡的人，是誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬萬娜·羅塞蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果說，這片大地上還有誰能讓德克薩斯真正回歸敘拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個人，不會是我，不會是貝納爾多，也不會是西西里夫人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而是她，喬萬娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜，你長高了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過了這麼多年，總是會長一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我見過你的幾個龍門朋友了，聽她們說了一些你的事，她們很擔心你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我沒想到她們也會來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們和你倒是完全不一樣，沒想到以你的性格還能交到這麼活潑的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不也是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真把我當朋友，就不會這麼久也不給我報個信了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，知道你肯定也有難言之隱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......其實沒什麼好說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"清算來得太突然了，哥倫比亞的家族人人自危，我看不過去，站出來主持了一下局面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後又和西西里夫人交流了一下，算是把事情擺平了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說得輕巧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這麼一說，我似乎應該向你訴苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我身邊已經太久沒有一個可以訴苦的人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你才把心思都放在了寫劇本上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你看出來了嗎，《德克薩斯之死》可是我的得意之作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些細節，也許只有你知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那看起來我的記性還算可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，第三幕，關於你的“死”，我一直沒有想好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來，這下我不用想了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實寫劇本還有一個目的。貝納爾多把家族的擔子交給兒子，自己在白日劇團擔任藝術總監，是一個公開的秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是想找個機會和這位接觸一下的，你也知道，家族成員會去做這種事的不太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，沒想到，做得最絕的，也是他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是在自己這一代把貝洛內家族壯大到這一程度的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，他是真的想要和西西里夫人扳手腕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起來並不緊張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能說，如果貝納爾多把你當成對付羅塞蒂的殺手鐧，那他未免有些太想當然了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你來找我是對的，切利尼娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你和貝洛內之間有什麼，我都可以幫你擺平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加入我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們兩個一起的話，一定能夠在敘拉古闖出一番事業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是因為你是薩爾瓦多雷的孫女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而是因為，我知道，你，切利尼娜，是有這個本事的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可以一起重新開始，切利尼娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是想知道，我是怎麼活下來的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬萬娜，我並不是因為僥倖才從那場清算中倖存的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你站在舞台上出演了這部歌舞劇......現在，你對七年前發生的事瞭解了多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"七年前......德克薩斯的父親朱塞佩謀殺了他的父親——薩爾瓦多雷，並且宣佈德克薩斯家族脫離敘拉古的掌控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這招致了西西里夫人的震怒，她派遣了由十二家族組成的精銳前往哥倫比亞對德克薩斯家族進行清算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是其中一員，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真聰明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那時，切利尼娜·德克薩斯是一個耀眼的名字，她來自哥倫比亞，卻能讓敘拉古人對她讚不絕口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直想要......勝過德克薩斯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勝過她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不不不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她被寄養在薩盧佐期間，我和她進行了無數次的比試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果各有勝負。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實想要勝過她，但這並不是發生後來那一切的關鍵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很關心她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，這也不是這個故事的關鍵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，至少告訴我，那一天，到底發生了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我參與了那場清算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我幻想了無數種，她為了她的家族與我廝殺的場景，每一種都令人血脈僨張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，那一天，那一幕，超乎我的所有想像。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你也是一個殺手，是嗎，丹布朗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭小姐，七年前，我在清算德克薩斯的隊伍之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我提前抵達了那座城市，在城裡找了一份洗車店的工作作為掩飾，暗中觀察著德克薩斯家族的一舉一動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那一天，來自敘拉古的隊伍到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而一群哥倫比亞人找到了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥倫比亞的家族成員們往往輕浮而又自大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原本可以輕鬆將他們解決，然而，他們之中，有一個特別的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道她，她也是個德克薩斯，但人們都說她像個敘拉古人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......切利尼娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到你，時而就會想到她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也像我一樣蠢，對一個殺手說了些有關理想的話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從沒有打算嘲笑你的理想，我只是覺得......很不可思議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽著你說那些事情的時候，就彷彿在聽一個美好的童話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我來說，你的理想因為太過美好，甚至成了能讓我安然入睡的秘方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天，我已經做好了動手的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信，她會看穿我的偽裝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她就像這樣，讓我經過了她的身邊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"narration","text":"觀眾們早已四散逃離，殺手們的戰場也早已轉移到別處。\n劇院中此時已經空空如也。\n拉普蘭德一邊說，一邊竟在空曠的舞台上踏起了輕巧的舞步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯家族的人已經幾乎被趕盡殺絕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，切利尼娜呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯獨切利尼娜不見蹤影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留下活口是不被允許的，何況是她這個長女，所有人都在尋找她的蹤跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一場大火就在這時發生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烈焰包裹了德克薩斯家族的宅邸，像是要將這個家族的存在吞噬殆盡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而大火的始作俑者，就站在門口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她緩緩轉身，向我走來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那一刻，我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對於德克薩斯家族的覆滅，她選擇了袖手旁觀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可誰又能指責她呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親謀殺了爺爺，她只是不願意成為那個幫兇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有她自己，有資格指責她自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，不止是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在那時候，從她眼中看到的是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厭倦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜的事......對薩盧佐家族來說，對我來說，並不是秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，當時帶領薩盧佐家族隊伍的，正是拉普蘭德大小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她被除名，正是因為她為了追殺切利尼娜而獨斷專行，最後導致家族成員遭到反撲，損失慘重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"narration","text":"我不會逃避，也不會別開視線。\n一直以來，她總是這樣告訴自己。\n但這一次，她發現，自己說不出口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看這一路上的屍體，聽聽遠處的喊殺聲吧，拉維妮婭小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能夠做到什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我唯一能建議你的，只有和切利尼娜一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑得越遠越好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使最後依然會被過去追上，至少，你獲得了一時的安寧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否則——你會死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是不想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的過去，敲開了她的門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她一開始或許是不情願的，但是當她被迫走出門外，發現一切沒有改變時——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定她會覺得，或許過去逃避的東西，也沒有那麼糟糕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在龍門的生活對她來說，不過是出了一趟遠門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......而現在，過去與她的家族聯繫最為緊密的人就在她的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想這麼告訴我，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果真的是這樣，我會尊重她的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使你們是最好的同伴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正因為我們是最好的同伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非——敘拉古的披薩哪天變得難以下嚥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爺爺是個念舊的人，他把我送來敘拉古，是想讓我不要忘本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在敘拉古生活了一段時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那段時間裡，許多人都說，我像個敘拉古人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但對我來說，我只是在做我一直以來在做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在哥倫比亞的生活方式，與我在敘拉古的生活方式別無二致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我在敘拉古見到的東西，和我在哥倫比亞見到的東西，並沒有什麼區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你對德克薩斯家的故事瞭若指掌，可我親眼目睹了那一幕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生活不是戲劇，那裡沒有發生一點屬於英雄或反派的情節。那只是一場實在算不上體面的謀殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親從黑鋼搞來了仿製銃，卻在擊發的時候炸膛了，傷到了自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爺爺摔倒在了地上，父親用傷了的手抽出刀，第一下卻刺偏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在門口聽到了一切，嘶啞的咒駡，痛苦的呻吟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些動靜持續了很久才結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在那一刻，對這一切感到了厭倦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我選擇了離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你想說，龍門才是你的歸宿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道，我無法確定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但至少，我在龍門的日子，過得還算開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還真是和過去一樣，總是有話直說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來，是我自作多情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為，你是來向我求助的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者至少，你應該想和我敘敘舊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來，你是來告訴我，我們再也回不到過去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知不知道，你這樣很過分，切利尼娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"擅自告訴我你還活著，給我驚喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又擅自熄滅我的希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，喬萬娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我既不想成為敘拉古人，也不想成為哥倫比亞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是切利尼娜·德克薩斯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你最後的機會，切利尼娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只要走出這扇門，就會成為我，成為羅塞蒂的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會成為羅塞蒂的障礙，而我，身為羅塞蒂家族的領袖，會毫不猶豫地清除攔在我面前的障礙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要逼我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬萬娜，我們都太念舊了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
